{"articleNo":"496293","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=496293&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 2024년 2학기 통영시 대학생 등록금 전액 지원사업 안내","writer":"학생성공과","writeDate":"2024.08.20","hit":"6407","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmBYHoQDkhXASgGwGICEDiBzADgUQEUBrAeVwEMAXABQCMALAKwCkA6J3bIA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p><br></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;mso-hansi-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">□ </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">사업개요</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">   </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">신청기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">: </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">2024. 8. 20.(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">) ~ 9. 28.(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">토</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">) 18:00</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">까지</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">   </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">지원대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">통영시에 주소를 둔 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">34</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">세 이하 대학 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">3~4</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">학년 재학생</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -120.2pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;* </span><span style=\"text-indent: -120.2pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt;\">추가지원대상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -120.2pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: 2024</span><span style=\"text-indent: -120.2pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -120.2pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">1</span><span style=\"text-indent: -120.2pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt;\">학기 국가장학금 미신청으로 지원 제외되었던 자에 대해 금회에 한하여 소급 신청 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -120.2pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"text-indent: -120.2pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt;\">자세한 사항은 추후 공고문 참고 바람</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -120.2pt; font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 93.8pt; text-indent: -93.8pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">   </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">지원내용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">대학 등록금 중 국가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">한국장학재단 등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">), </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">학교에서 지원받는 등록금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">장학금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">등을 제외한 본인부담금을 최소 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">30% ~ </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">최대 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">100% </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">지원 </span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">   </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">신청방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">홈페이지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">(tyss.or.kr)</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">를 통한 온라인 신청 및 우편</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">이메일 접수 등</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt;\">마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt;\">필요서류</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림체; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt;\">자세한 사항은 홈페이지 또는 안내문 참조</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
